      "content": "the \"silence\" you're talking about... it just feels like an end. like everything is over. honestly, when i think about that silence, it feels more peaceful than the struggle. it feels like the only way to actually stop the bleeding is to just stop everything. does that make sense? that maybe there's no point in trying to rebuild something that was never real to begin with?",
